+
+The separate `CssDerivation.NumberLexical` import connects the fixed typed number document to a byte lexical model on normalized ASCII number-entry inputs. Its [source transport and scope](research/derivation/number-lexical/README.md) preserve 457 theorem audits, exact lexical observations and actual-file execution without a Firefox dependency. Run `python3 -B number_lexical_check.py --lean /path/to/lean --out /tmp/number-lexical-check` for its cold source-only gate. This opt-in extension does not add a main CSS coverage claim or prove native Rust or floating-point correctness.
